[{"speaker":"","text":"我换好衣服后，又开始思考梦中的事。","art":{"background":"a2602","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-3"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「“放心生活便可”。它这么说，一定是因为它还没有满足」","art":{"background":"a2602","sprites":[{"asset":"a321","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-3"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「它依旧……附在我身上」","art":{"background":"a2602","sprites":[{"asset":"a326","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-3"},{"speaker":"","text":"但是不会变成狗已经是万幸了。","art":{"background":"a2602","sprites":[{"asset":"a1043","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-3"},{"speaker":"","text":"不用担心什么时候会变成狗，这就足够了。","art":{"background":"a2602","sprites":[{"asset":"a1043","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-3"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「都已经能这样交谈了，所以肯定不是我偶然做的梦」","art":{"background":"a2602","sprites":[{"asset":"a427","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-3"},{"speaker":"","text":"也就是说……当时流入我心中的感情也……","art":{"background":"a2602","sprites":[{"asset":"a427","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-3"},{"speaker":"？？？","text":"『……呵呵』","art":{"background":"a1044","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-3"},{"speaker":"","text":"……那位女性让我感受到了一种特别的安宁感。仅仅只是和她待在一起，就会觉得内心无比放松。","art":{"background":"a1044","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-3"},{"speaker":"","text":"也就是说——","art":{"background":"a1044","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-3"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「其实，你也恋爱了吧……？」","art":{"background":"a2602","sprites":[{"asset":"a334","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-3"},{"speaker":"","text":"但是，对方却喜欢上了别人。","art":{"background":"a2602","sprites":[{"asset":"a334","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-3"},{"speaker":"","text":"并且为了这份恋情，献出了自己的性命。","art":{"background":"a2602","sprites":[{"asset":"a334","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-3"},{"speaker":"？？？","text":"『如果有朝一日你也有了喜欢的人，你就会明白的』","art":{"background":"a1044","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-3"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「你真正想知道的，是她的感受吗……？」","art":{"background":"a2602","sprites":[{"asset":"a630","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-3"},{"speaker":"","text":"当然了，没有人回答我的问题。","art":{"background":"a2602","sprites":[{"asset":"a630","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-3"},{"speaker":"","text":"但是胸口却传来一阵刺痛。","art":{"background":"a2602","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-3"},{"speaker":"","text":"简直就像——","art":{"background":"a2602","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-3"},{"speaker":"","text":"『都说了让你赶紧忘掉！』","art":{"background":"a2602","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-3"},{"speaker":"","text":"就像它在冲我怒吼一样。","art":{"background":"a2602","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-3"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「哈哈，也对，这种事情我想再多也没用」","art":{"background":"a2602","sprites":[{"asset":"a552","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-3"},{"speaker":"茉子","text":"「为了能够让将臣露出笑容，今天也要加油才行」","art":{"background":"a2602","sprites":[{"asset":"a249","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"6-3"}]